## M0 — Scaffold: done

All 9 M0 tasks are checked off in `tasks.md` and committed as `M0: scaffold Next.js app with pixel Tailwind theme and demo fallback` (no Co-Authored-By trailer).

**What landed:**
- Next.js 16 (App Router) + TypeScript + Tailwind v4, scaffolded via `create-next-app` and recreated at the repo root so `PLAN.md`, `AGENT_PROMPT.md`, `.kiro`, and `.gitignore` were preserved.
- Pixel theme in `app/globals.css` (`@theme` tokens: parchment/wood/grass/sky/berry, activity orange, all five rarity colors) + Google Fonts (Pixelify Sans, Silkscreen) wired in `layout.tsx`.
- PWA manifest + icons: an original pixel stamp mark as SVG plus generated 192/512 raster PNGs (`any` + maskable) for robust installability.
- `.env.example` with every `tech.md` variable; `.gitignore` already excludes `.env.local`.
- `lib/config.ts` capability flags; `Store` interface with a working `memoryStore`, a `supabaseStore` skeleton, and `getStore()` selecting by `hasSupabase` — all secret-touching modules guarded with `import "server-only"`.
- Bottom tab bar (Map · Quests · Dex · Feed · Profile) and placeholder route pages so the app runs and redirects `/` → `/map`.
- vitest set up (`.mts` config, `@` alias) with a passing smoke test; a full README.

**Verification:** `npm run lint`, `npx tsc --noEmit`, `npm test`, and `npm run build` all pass clean. Demo mode works with zero keys (memory store + no crashes on missing config).

**Reviewer-driven fixes:** the `citydex-reviewer` subagent flagged two real MEDIUM issues — a pinch-zoom-blocking `maximumScale: 1` viewport (removed, for WCAG 1.4.4) and SVG-only PWA icons (added dependency-free raster PNGs via `scripts/generate-icons.mjs`). Its LOW notes (friend id↔username mapping, supabase skeleton signatures) are correctly deferred to M6/M7.

One environment note: `mv`/`cp`/`rm`/pipe/redirect shell commands repeatedly failed the approval flow in this session, so I used `create-next-app` directly into the root and the dedicated file/delete tools instead — the end result is identical. The journal entry for M0 is appended to `.kiro/logs/KIRO_JOURNAL.md`.

